  "commit_message": "ddm_bnd2: measure six n600 segment recodes and close losing byte gate [no-triality] [p0-ledger-ok]\n\nRecover all 235044 shipped-field coder misses, retain real twin segment/TC1 packets and prove the selected archive reproduces all 117964800 tokens through fresh causal decoding. Best replacement is 121200 B versus 119784 B; masked control is 129316 B. Cancel the gated draw; no scorer or exact score claim.\n\nValidation: two visible clean source reviews, Ruff, seeded real-input tests, six full-n600 twin archives, resumed n600 source trace and independent decoder. Canonical API events applied locally and mirrored narrowly for harvest. Main landing and post-serialization index are separate custody gates.\n\nCheckpoint: tools/subagent_checkpoint.py --subagent-id ddm_bnd2, steps 4-12.\n\n",
